      authenticator check: valid=5 invalid=0 unpaired=0

tb277$ radwire t33409-on.pcap --port 11812 --port 11813 --secret testing456
      Access-Accept 2, Access-Reject 3, Access-Request 5
      authenticator check: valid=5 invalid=0 unpaired=0

tb277$ radwire t33409-on.pcap --port 11812 --port 11813 --secret testing123   <-- cross-check
      authenticator check: valid=0 invalid=5 unpaired=0

